        {
          "categoryId": "video",
          "defaultValue": "OFF",
          "description": {
            "en": "Simulates LCD ghosting effects. 'Simple' performs a 50:50 mix of the current and previous frames. 'Smart' attempts to detect screen flickering, and only performs a 50:50 mix on affected pixels. 'LCD Ghosting' mimics natural LCD response times by combining multiple buffered frames. 'Simple' or 'Smart' blending is required when playing games that aggressively exploit LCD ghosting for transparency effects (Wave Race, Chikyuu Kaihou Gun ZAS, F-Zero, the Boktai series...).",
            "zh-Hans": "模拟 LCD 残影。「简单」将当前帧与上一帧等比例混合；「智能」只混合检测到闪烁的像素；「LCD 残影」通过多帧模拟液晶响应。部分游戏（如《F-Zero》《太阳少年》系列）依赖交替闪烁实现半透明效果，可尝试简单或智能混合。"
          },
          "key": "mgba_interframe_blending",
          "restartRequired": false,
          "title": {
            "en": "Interframe Blending",
            "zh-Hans": "帧混合"
          },
